# INF-3787 / Wave 1 (v2.3.0.0) — glide-path render verbs land here in Phase 2.
#
# Substrate slot reserved per Option A (compose-only path, audit comment #1).
# Three render verbs will populate this directory:
#   baselineBar.ts    — dashed-outline baseline (committed) bar
#   actualSegment.ts  — solid-fill actual (recorded) segment, bounded to today
#   slipChevron.ts    — drift indicator (chevron pointing forecast direction)
#
# All verbs match the existing d3-lifecycle signature:
#   (g, items[], xScale, rowHeight, colors) -> Selection
#
# Orchestrated by src/render/gantt/glidePath.ts (Phase 3, sibling not in
# this dir — orchestrator stays at gantt/ level alongside other top-level
# renderers like swimlanes.ts).
